    "\n",
    "## Current execution mode\n",
    "\n",
    "`RUN_STAGE = \"all\"` is enabled.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Run All will perform the full production workflow, including upload, only if\n",
    "every preceding gate passes.** The new reconciliation gate will stop the run\n",
    "if repeated flightline copies differ in size or content.\n",
    "\n",
    "The notebook never modifies or deletes the CyVerse source collection.\n"
   ]
  },
