    "\n",
    "## 2. DISCOVER stage: locate the actual package API\n",
    "\n",
    "This scans the checked-out `spectralbridge` package for the required production\n",
    "objects instead of assuming their module locations.\n",
    "\n",
    "Required:\n",
    "- `run_bulk_pipeline`\n",
    "- `DEFAULT_PRODUCT_REGISTRY`\n",
    "\n",
    "Optional:\n",
    "- `summarize_bulk_results`\n",
    "- `BulkResultsConfig`\n",
    "\n",
    "If compact summarization is unavailable, the bulk analysis can still run and be\n",
    "packaged. The notebook records that summarization is unsupported by this checkout\n",
    "instead of failing before any useful work happens.\n"
   ]
  },
